位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "8d5e9a44dcbc14e06cbf", "mechanism": "invisibility", "mechanism_zh": "隐身", "definition": "使自身、队友、召唤物或复制体隐身", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "c69d5bd7631a65f570d5", "mechanism": "mana_burn", "mechanism_zh": "烧蓝/法力削减", "definition": "减少目标的法力值", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:rattletrap_power_cogs:terrain:base", "mechanism": "terrain", "mechanism_zh": "创造地形", "definition": "在地上造出单位不能穿过的地形，无视地形的单位能越过", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "razor_static_link", "name_zh": "雷泽·静电连接", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Creates a charged link between Razor and an enemy Hero, stealing damage from the target and giving it to Razor. Allows Razor to attack while moving with the link active.", "notes_loc": ["The link is broken when either unit dies or the distance between them becomes %drain_range_buffer% units greater than Static Link's cast range."], "shard_loc": "Increases Cast Range. Slows Razor's target by %move_speed_factor%x the amount of damage stolen while the link is active."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Creates a charged link between Razor and an enemy Hero, stealing damage from the target and giving it to Razor. Allows Razor to attack while moving with the link active.", "notes_loc": ["The link is broken when either unit dies or the distance between them becomes %drain_range_buffer% units greater than Static Link's cast range."], "shard_loc": "Increases Cast Range. Slows Razor's target by %move_speed_factor%x the amount of damage stolen while the link is active."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [65], "new": [45, 50, 55, 60]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [65], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [45, 50, 55, 60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:razor_static_link:attack_damage_reduction:base", "mechanism": "attack_damage_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减攻击力", "definition": "降低目标的攻击力", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "016539c7f2702ba7c539", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "razor_storm_surge", "name_zh": "雷泽·风暴涌动", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "There's a chance when attacked, and always when targeted with a spell, to release a forked lightning that strikes the target and other nearby enemies, prioritizing the unit type of the attacker, dealing damage and slowing movement speed.", "notes_loc": ["Damage done by this ability is considered reflected damage. Reflected damage does not provide any lifesteal and cannot be reflected."], "shard_loc": "While Eye of the Storm is active, strike chance is %eye_of_the_storm_chance_multiplier%x as high, strike cooldown is reduced by %strike_cd_reduction_during_storm%s, and Lightning strikes all enemies within Eye of the Storm's radius. Does not apply to the same enemy twice from a single instance."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "There's a chance when attacked, and always when targeted with a spell, to release a forked lightning that strikes the target and other nearby enemies, prioritizing the unit type of the attacker, dealing damage and slowing movement speed.", "notes_loc": ["Damage done by this ability is considered reflected damage. Reflected damage does not provide any lifesteal and cannot be reflected."], "shard_loc": "While Eye of the Storm is active, strike chance is %eye_of_the_storm_chance_multiplier%x as high, strike cooldown is reduced by %strike_cd_reduction_during_storm%s, and Lightning strikes all enemies within Eye of the Storm's radius. Does not apply to the same enemy twice from a single instance."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "strike_damage", "old": {"base": [50, 90, 130, 170], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [65, 100, 135, 170], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "54e2ac9a9a51955a1d58", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d664ac635b1dc3630fd5", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1172797398284f1241a9", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "cb9703c982ff6e75b46f", "mechanism": "damage_return", "mechanism_zh": "反伤", "definition": "受到攻击或伤害时触发的反击伤害：按比例返还所受伤害、固定值反击，或受伤触发的范围伤害（如半人马·反伤、斧王·反击螺旋、钢毛后背）；攻击者不一定被打到也算，记条件", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "4a7958777189926b82dc", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "9bb35f5f5ac67b440478", "mechanism": "spell_reflect", "mechanism_zh": "反弹指向技能", "definition": "把指向技能反弹给施法者", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "revenants_brooch", "name_zh": "英灵胸针", "category": "5_增删或退出", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Phantom Critical Grants each attack a %crit_chance%%% chance to deal an additional %crit_multiplier%%% of the attack's damage as bonus magic damage.", "notes_loc": ["Counts as a Critical Strike for purposes of stacking with other sources of Critical Strike.", "Phantom Critical does not work against buildings."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Ghastly Strike Grants each attack a %crit_chance%%% chance to deal an additional %crit_multiplier%%% of the attack's damage as bonus magical damage.", "notes_loc": ["Counts as a critical strike, and so does not stack with other critical strikes.", "Does not work against buildings."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage", "old": 0, "new": 2}, {"field": "immunity", "old": 4, "new": 0}, {"field": "item_cost", "old": 3300, "new": 0}, {"field": "bonus_damage", "old": {"base": [35], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "crit_chance", "old": {"base": [30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "crit_multiplier", "old": {"base": [80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "spell_lifesteal", "old": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "373bad5e1b62a0fa41d0", "mechanism": "critical", "mechanism_zh": "暴击", "definition": "攻击造成额外倍数伤害；有概率触发或强化下一次攻击都算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:revenants_brooch:lifesteal:item", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f800d32316a011659b31", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "riki_innate_backstab", "name_zh": "力丸·背刺", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Every time Riki strikes his enemy from behind, he deals additional bonus damage equal to a multiple of his Agility.", "notes_loc": ["Works when denying friendly units at %ally_multiplier%%% effectiveness.", "Illusions of Riki will play Backstab animations, but not deal any bonus damage."], "facets_loc": ["Riki receives bonus experience for assists and kills."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Every time Riki strikes his enemy from behind, he deals additional bonus damage equal to a multiple of his Agility and his attack has increased Item Potency.", "notes_loc": ["Works when denying friendly units at %ally_multiplier%%% effectiveness.", "Illusions of Riki will play Backstab animations, but not deal any bonus damage."], "facets_loc": ["Riki receives bonus experience for assists and kills."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_potency", "old": null, "new": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "8d242fe0365e9542324f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:riki_innate_backstab:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "41d24c9ce976581e3ff3", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "riki_smoke_screen", "name_zh": "力丸·烟幕", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Throws down a smoke bomb, silencing enemies and causing them to miss attacks.", "notes_loc": ["Can be cast during Tricks of the Trade.", "Doesn't prevent the use of active items."], "shard_loc": "Enemies caught in the smoke screen have their armor reduced by %armor_reduction% and cannot be targeted by their allies."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Throws down a smoke bomb, silencing enemies and causing them to miss attacks.", "notes_loc": ["Can be cast during Tricks of the Trade.", "Doesn't prevent the use of active items."], "shard_loc": "Enemies caught in the smoke screen have their armor reduced by %armor_reduction% and cannot be targeted by their allies."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "durations", "old": [6], "new": [4.5, 5, 5.5, 6]}, {"field": "AbilityDuration", "old": {"base": [6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [4.5, 5, 5.5, 6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "miss_rate", "old": {"base": [40, 50, 60, 70], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [55, 60, 65, 70], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "radius", "old": {"base": [425], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [400], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "a53442cc42301fcba649", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0dd492cfa75e6b123b4f", "mechanism": "blind", "mechanism_zh": "致盲", "definition": "使敌方单位的攻击有概率落空", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:riki_smoke_screen:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "eceba00df5609ea59f76", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "ringmaster_funhouse_mirror", "name_zh": "百戏大王·哈哈镜", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Use: Proportion Distortion Creates %images_count% imperfect image of your hero that lasts %illusion_duration% seconds. Your illusion deals %tooltip_damage_outgoing_ranged%%% and takes %tooltip_damage_incoming_total_pct%%% damage.", "notes_loc": ["Has a %invuln_duration% second cast time during which you are invulnerable."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Use: Proportion Distortion Creates %images_count% imperfect image of your hero that lasts %illusion_duration% seconds. Your illusion deals %tooltip_damage_outgoing_ranged%%% and takes %tooltip_damage_incoming_total_pct%%% damage.", "notes_loc": ["Has a %invuln_duration% second cast time during which you are invulnerable."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "illusion_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5f21849dccfb8ef3c076", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "t5:ringmaster_funhouse_mirror:illusions", "mechanism": "illusions", "mechanism_zh": "幻象", "definition": "制造自身或他人的幻象", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d79ed5e415c0a80d3e82", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "ringmaster_impalement", "name_zh": "百戏大王·尖刀戏", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Ringmaster throws one of his daggers to a precise point of his choosing. If he strikes an enemy, the dagger deals impact damage, briefly slows the unit hit, and causes them to bleed. The bleeding deals a percentage of the victim's maximum health in damage every second to heroes and flat damage per second to creeps."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Ringmaster throws one of his daggers to a precise point of his choosing. If he strikes an enemy, the dagger deals impact damage, briefly slows the unit hit, and causes them to bleed. The bleeding deals a percentage of the victim's maximum health in damage every second to heroes and flat damage per second to creeps."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage_impact", "old": {"base": [20, 35, 50, 65], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20, 40, 60, 80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "3b561db282f26e340ce0", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "490457eb1fc261bedc5d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "ringmaster_spotlight", "name_zh": "百戏大王·聚光灯", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Ringmaster shines %spotlight_count% spotlights that sweep over an area. Enemies in the light have a chance to miss their attacks and are revealed if invisible. Illusions hit by the beam fade away, losing a percentage of their maximum health each second. These effects linger for %linger_duration% seconds after leaving the light."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Ringmaster shines %spotlight_count% spotlights that sweep over an area. Enemies in the light have a chance to miss their attacks and are revealed if invisible. Illusions hit by the beam fade away, losing a percentage of their maximum health each second. These effects linger for %linger_duration% seconds after leaving the light."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "miss_chance", "old": {"base": [30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [45], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "1e87b69386a7102b1359", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "031f6a1e7ed9b7a29b18", "mechanism": "blind", "mechanism_zh": "致盲", "definition": "使敌方单位的攻击有概率落空", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:ringmaster_spotlight:ground_zone:shard", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "5460640e23f83695d76e", "mechanism": "reveal", "mechanism_zh": "显形", "definition": "使隐身单位显形，不等于持续真视", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d0745c9f52aeb96aa35c", "mechanism": "true_sight", "mechanism_zh": "真视", "definition": "可看见隐身单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "ringmaster_summon_unicycle", "name_zh": "百戏大王·独轮车", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Use: Saddle Up Summons a speedy unicycle to ride around on for %mount_duration% seconds. %damage_grace_period%s after mounting the unicycle, taking damage from enemy hero sources greater than %damage_threshold% dismounts the rider. Crashing into trees destroys them and slows the unicycle. Attacking, using channeled abilities, or crashing into units and other obstacles also dismounts the rider."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Use: Saddle U